de__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.neverborncomic.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.neverborncomic.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/chorus_page460.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.neverborncomic.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> Chorus of the Neverborn &ndash; The Story of Creation's Most Dysfunctional Family </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.neverborncomic.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.neverborncomic.com/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T10:48:35-08:00","id":23836,"title":"","content":"Creation's Gambit<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://creationsgambit.rpdom.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://creationsgambit.rpdom.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://creationsgambit.rpdom.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://creationsgambit.rpdom.com/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/845-dragonmystic","name":"Dragonmystic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T11:14:39-08:00","id":23846,"title":"","content":"To my knowledge, that's a pretty exhaustive list, unfortunately. I didn't even know of Creation's Gambit, I'll admit.<br /> <br /> For completion, let me mention <a href=\"http://twocircles.smackjeeves.com/comics/814506/exalted-101/\" target=\"_blank\">Two Circles</a>. 16 pages in total, ran between 1st of March and 24th of May 2010. Kind of cute, but never got off the ground.<br /> <br /> Something I did have hopes for, however, was <a href=\"http://lafreeze.deviantart.com/gallery/28821507\" target=\"_blank\">Tales of the Mastah</a>, a Keychain spinoff that for a time was hosted on patternspider.net before they took it down when they changed names to rpdom.com. The DeviantArt archive still remains. This one, I honestly had high hopes for. The 16 pages that got produced are actually good. It doesn't take ages getting going, and some of the early characters are pretty interesting. Unfortunately, it started up twice and fell flat on the same god damn page both times. I can sympathise; sometimes something is more work than you think. Just wish it could have pulled through.<br /> <br /> Edit: Oh, and also! If we (that is, I) are doing the completionist thing, I'd be remiss if I didn't mention <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/sh/3hoyqzetyxv0ugp/AKROSkOBAQ\" target=\"_blank\">The Freedom Stone</a>. It's the grandmother of the Exalted webcomics. By the time I even heard of it, it was long since abandoned, and by the current day I don't think you can find it anywhere on the internet in its complete form. The link above is a collection of pages the author posted on the old White Wolf forums a while ago. It's far from comprehensive, but it's what she had available without having to revive a couple fried hard-drives.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 12-05-2013, 02:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T12:52:32-08:00","id":23907,"title":"","content":"Oh, man, do I miss the Freedom Stone...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T14:02:03-08:00","id":23962,"title":"","content":"My goal is to be as completionist as humanly possible. If it's a webcomic, available online somewhere, and about Exalted, I want it on the list.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T14:17:58-08:00","id":23970,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/23830-exalted-webcomics-old-and-new?p=23907#post23907\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, man, do I miss the Freedom Stone...</div> </div> </div> </div>I wish I could read it. Even when I first found <a href=\"http://www.thefreedomstone.com/phpBB3/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">the Freedom Stone forums</a>, I think it was off the web. I know that one of the characters got featured in MoeP: DBs, so it must have been a pretty big thing.<br /> <br /> Edit: Also, SamuraiMujuru, I think it's safe to say that Two Circles and Tales of the Mastah are never coming back. Jukashi has stated a desire to return to Keychain (though it remains to be seen if that actually happens of course), while nothing of that kind has been heard from the other authors. Saying indefinite hiatus is saying too much. They're ended.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 12-05-2013, 05:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T14:23:58-08:00","id":23975,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/23830-exalted-webcomics-old-and-new?p=23970#post23970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wish I could read it. Even when I first found <a href=\"http://www.thefreedomstone.com/phpBB3/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">the Freedom Stone forums</a>, I think it was off the web. I know that one of the characters got featured in MoeP: DBs, so it must have been a pretty big thing.<br /> <br /> Edit: Also, SamuraiMujuru, I think it's safe to say that Two Circles and Tales of the Mastah are never coming back. Jukashi has stated a desire to return to Keychain (though it remains to be seen if that actually happens of course), while nothing of that kind has been heard from the other authors. Saying indefinite hiatus is saying too much. They're ended.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ahh, cool, I'll update the side comments. As for The Freedom Stone, the Dropbox link provided apparently has all the pages in downloadable form.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T17:02:37-08:00","id":24075,"title":"","content":"My only claim to fame is that Jade Cricket is an old highschool friend of mine, and Cricket and Reed were created for the very first Exalted game I ever played in. Actually, the author is the one who drew my avatar, a character for a game I GMed last year. She's a super cool lady and I always wished she'd continued The Freedom Stone. Yay, I'm 2 degrees from Internet Famous! +1!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T17:24:27-08:00","id":24078,"title":"","content":"I started an MSPFA set in Creation one time. I've got to stop starting new projects at the beginning of semesters before I know what the workload is.<br /> <br /> But yeah, <a href=\"http://www.mspaforums.com/showthread.php?45108-GODTRAPPED-Play-the-game-Save-Creation-%28Exalted-urb%29\" target=\"_blank\">Godtrapped</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm working on it, all right?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/130-gensh","name":"Gensh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar130_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"128"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T18:56:59-08:00","id":24113,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gensh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/23830-exalted-webcomics-old-and-new?p=24078#post24078\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I started an MSPFA set in Creation one time. I've got to stop starting new projects at the beginning of semesters before I know what the workload is.<br /> <br /> But yeah, <a href=\"http://www.mspaforums.com/showthread.php?45108-GODTRAPPED-Play-the-game-Save-Creation-%28Exalted-urb%29\" target=\"_blank\">Godtrapped</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is awesome and your MSPA forum avatar is great.<br /> <br /> I was always kind of tempted to do an extremely non-canonical MSPFA about post-Usurpation Solars hiding out in the Invisible Fortress, but it would really need to use the &quot;wall of text under the panel&quot; format, I think, because 99% of the point of it is that it'd be hilarious to establish the personalities and then have huge pesterlogs of them talking about bullshit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/104-gayo","name":"Gayo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar104_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1948"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T20:22:39-08:00","id":24144,"title":"","content":"Hey thanks for including HvSf!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T20:27:35-08:00","id":24148,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gayo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/23830-exalted-webcomics-old-and-new?p=24113#post24113\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That is awesome and your MSPA forum avatar is great.<br /> <br /> I was always kind of tempted to do an extremely non-canonical MSPFA about post-Usurpation Solars hiding out in the Invisible Fortress, but it would really need to use the &quot;wall of text under the panel&quot; format, I think, because 99% of the point of it is that it'd be hilarious to establish the personalities and then have huge pesterlogs of them talking about bullshit.</div> </div> </div> </div>I must concur. Very awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-06T04:07:22-08:00","id":24277,"title":"","content":"I have something akin to an Exalted webcomic on my tumblr: <a href=\"http://asktheexaltedponies.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://asktheexaltedponies.tumblr.com/</a><br /> <br /> ...its a pony/exalted crossover, but with an all OC cast<br /> <br /> Also its been a while since I've updated it - but ideally I should be able to fix that soon enough","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-06T10:50:59-08:00","id":24448,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>webkilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/23830-exalted-webcomics-old-and-new?p=24277#post24277\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have something akin to an Exalted webcomic on my tumblr: <a href=\"http://asktheexaltedponies.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://asktheexaltedponies.tumblr.com/</a><br /> <br /> ...its a pony/exalted crossover, but with an all OC cast<br /> <br /> Also its been a while since I've updated it - but ideally I should be able to fix that soon enough</div> </div> </div> </div>Cool, got it added to the list!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-06T13:09:40-08:00","id":24585,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://tgchan.org/wiki/Lunar_Quest\" target=\"_blank\">Lunar Quest</a> is is sort of like an interactive web comic where the readers cast their votes on what the main character does next. A little hard to read in that format, but pretty cool if you put in the effort to do so imho.<br /> <br /> Here's some direct links to <a href=\"http://tgchan.org/kusaba/questarch/res/88264.html\" target=\"_blank\">Chapter 1</a>, <a href=\"http://tgchan.org/kusaba/questarch/res/399781.html\" target=\"_blank\">Chapter 2</a>, and <a href=\"http://tgchan.org/kusaba/questarch/res/474224.html\" target=\"_blank\">Internal Phase 1</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1837-show-us-your-commissions-2-the-revenge?p=23024#post23024\" target=\"_blank\">Lunar Art</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1508-sydriam","name":"Sydriam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1508_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-06T14:21:27-08:00","id":24645,"title":"","content":"Lunar Quest is Jukashi's other Exalted-ish project. If Keychain deviates from canon a bit, Lunar Quest uses canon as vague outlines at best. I personally have a bit of a problem with the quest format, but many seem to like it.<br /> <br /> Since Lunar Quests moves away from the traditional webcomic format, it might be worth asking if the OP is interested in fanfics and other media as well? Because if so, I feel <a href=\"https://www.fanfiction.net/s/8107629/\" target=\"_blank\">Glorious Shotgun Princess</a> should be mentioned. Mass Effect, if Shepard was a Zenith. Probably easier to appreciate if you've actually played Mass Effect, but I've read a few chapters and it's pretty well written for fanfiction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-06T14:39:35-08:00","id":24657,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/23830-exalted-webcomics-old-and-new?p=24645#post24645\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lunar Quest is Jukashi's other Exalted-ish project. If Keychain deviates from canon a bit, Lunar Quest uses canon as vague outlines at best. I personally have a bit of a problem with the quest format, but many seem to like it.<br /> <br /> Since Lunar Quests moves away from the traditional webcomic format, it might be worth asking if the OP is interested in fanfics and other media as well? Because if so, I feel <a href=\"https://www.fanfiction.net/s/8107629/\" target=\"_blank\">Glorious Shotgun Princess</a> should be mentioned. Mass Effect, if Shepard was a Zenith. Probably easier to appreciate if you've actually played Mass Effect, but I've read a few chapters and it's pretty well written for fanfiction.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, my original purpose was just webcomics, but I figure I could add notable Fan-fic/other media. I wouldn't want to even TRY to all ALL fanfic/other media, but if there's any &quot;Must read/watch/listen!&quot; I'd be more than happy to add them.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T09:52:21-08:00","id":25189,"title":"","content":"Does anyone know a good hosting site for webcomics?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":