ming in the Void born of the timing of cunning by knowing the enemies' timing, and thus using a timing which the enemy does not expect.&quot; <i>Shinmen Musashi no Kami Fujiwara no Genshin, Go Rin No Sho (The Book of the Five Rings)</i>","edited":{"userid":2141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2141-nadrakas","user":"Nadrakas","date":". 02-01-2014, 11:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2141-nadrakas","name":"Nadrakas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2141_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T00:47:33-08:00","id":63337,"title":"","content":"My Little Exalt. For the Pony fans out there.<br /> (From what I've read so far, the FanFiction is actually quite good.)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.fimfiction.net/story/36641/My-Little-Exalt\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.fimfiction.net/story/36641/My-Little-Exalt</a><br /> <br /> ~ N","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is timing in everything. Timing in strategy cannot be mastered without a great deal of practice. There is also timing in the Void. You win battles with the timing in the Void born of the timing of cunning by knowing the enemies' timing, and thus using a timing which the enemy does not expect.&quot; <i>Shinmen Musashi no Kami Fujiwara no Genshin, Go Rin No Sho (The Book of the Five Rings)</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2141-nadrakas","name":"Nadrakas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2141_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T03:30:03-08:00","id":63366,"title":"","content"