ank\">http://asktheexaltedponies.tumblr.com/page/5</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T07:24:13-08:00","id":318933,"title":"","content":"I wonder if the lack of a game to play has something to do with so many prominent works being alive and strong lately.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T08:07:18-08:00","id":318969,"title":"","content":"Thanks for this. I've made it one of the useful links in the sticky thread.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-23T09:29:42-08:00","id":319942,"title":"","content":"I think the link to Creation's Gambit is no longer valid. Try this one instead: <a href=\"http://www.creationsgambit.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.creationsgambit.com/</a><br /> <br /> Also, I just spotted the fanfic <a href=\"https://www.fanfiction.net/s/6654901/1/A-Green-Sun-Illuminates-the-Void\" target=\"_blank\">A Green Sun Illuminates the Void</a> by EarthScorpion. I haven't read it, but it's by EarthScorpion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-23T09:47:24-08:00","id":319994,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gonzo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/23830-exalted-webcomics-old-and-new?p=318933#post318933\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if the lack of a game to play has something to do with so many prominent works being alive and strong lately.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mmm, I don't know. I don't think the presence of comics or fanfics are stronger or weaker than they were before, or if they are, that it's to do with the activity of the game line: Keychain lived its entire life during 2e, and most of the others at least started their run during that time as well. Unless I'm mistaken, the ones to start after the announcement of 3e is Heaven's Strife, Cursed City of Makers, Creation's Gambit and God-Kicking Boot, which I'll admit might be a slight increase compared to before, but it might as well be an effect of Keychain, Agents of Yu-Shan and Chorus of the Neverborn affirming the idea of Exalted as a setting for comics better than previously.<br /> <br /> Still, I agree that there's currently a few comics that are showing great promise, not least of those your own, and I'm very very happy about that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-30T10:51:28-08:00","id":326160,"title":"","content":"Well, apparently neither Creation's Gambit nor Manse of Ivy's links are working - anyone else having problems with them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-30T11:21:02-08:00","id":326165,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"b